{
  "finding": "recoverArtifact 的调用方 syncDailyBoard 忽略返回布尔值，导致恢复成功路径与同轮降级路径之间缺少显式分流。更关键的断点是：当 seat.status 已经变成 generation_unknown_no_repurchase（例如上一轮 sync 因无唯一候选而降级），artifact 文件随后由外部流程或其他副本恢复到位时，recoverArtifact 会接受 generation_unknown_no_repurchase 状态并恢复为 generated_pending_sync；但 syncDailyBoard 在同轮先调用 recoverArtifact 后，恢复后的 generated_pending_sync 会落入后续同步分支。实际断点在于同步分支继续执行 validateArtifact 之前，没有先检查 seat.recovery 或返回状态，也没有在恢复成功时立即保存后 continue，因此可能与同轮后续快照/readRemote 产生非预期顺序；而 scripts/daily-task-board.mjs 的 sync 分支在同一次 Node 进程内调用 syncDailyBoard 两次，使恢复后的席位可能在第二次调用中被重复处理或错误降级。具体表现为：第一次 sync 中 recoverArtifact 返回 true 且状态变为 generated_pending_sync，但 syncDailyBoard 未返回或继续；第二次 sync 中该席位进入同步逻辑，既未验证恢复事件在场，也没有阻止同轮重复验证。",
  "evidence_paths": [
    "scripts/lib/daily-task-board.mjs",
    "scripts/daily-task-board.mjs"
  ],
  "minimal_patch": "--- a/scripts/lib/daily-task-board.mjs
+++ b/scripts/lib/daily-task-board.mjs
@@ -239,7 +239,13 @@ export async function syncDailyBoard({root, date, snapshot, command, readRemote
   if (!record) return null;
   if (record.date !== date) throw Error('reservation_date_mismatch');
   for (const [agent, seat] of Object.entries(record.seats)) {
-    recoverArtifact(root,record,agent,seat);
+    const recovered = recoverArtifact(root,record,agent,seat);
+    if (recovered && seat.status === 'generated_pending_sync') {
+      seat.sync_reason = 'immutable_artifact_recovered_in_sync';
+      seat.recovery = seat.recovery || 'immutable_artifact_verified_no_model_replay';
+      saveLedger(root,record);
+      continue;
+    }
     if(seat.assignment&&seat.claim_verified&&['missing_required_section','generation_failed_no_repurchase','failure_sync_unknown','failed_no_repurchase'].includes(seat.status)){await syncFailedSeat({root,record,agent,seat,snapshot,command,readRemote,now});continue;}
     if (seat.status === 'generation_started') {
       seat.status = 'generation_unknown_no_repurchase';
@@ -249,6 +255,7 @@ export async function syncDailyBoard({root, date, snapshot, command, readRemote
       saveLedger(root,record);
     }
+    if (seat.recovery && seat.status === 'generated_pending_sync') continue;
     if (!seat.assignment || !seat.claim_verified || !seat.artifact || !['generated_pending_sync','sync_unknown','submitted_pending_review','review_unknown','completed_draft_review','rejected_draft_review'].includes(seat.status)) continue;",
  "verification_commands": [
    "node --check scripts/lib/daily-task-board.mjs",
    "node --check scripts/daily-task-board.mjs",
    "grep -n "continue" scripts/lib/daily-task-board.mjs | head -20",
    "grep -n "recovered" scripts/lib/daily-task-board.mjs",
    "git diff -- scripts/lib/daily-task-board.mjs"
  ],
  "remaining_blocker": "尚未在故障注入环境中实证 artifact 已写盘但 ledger 为 generation_started 或 generation_unknown_no_repurchase 的两种恢复路径；也未运行受控测试验证补丁在恢复成功时确实跳过同轮后续同步，且第二次 syncDailyBoard 调用不会清除恢复状态。"
}
